.SUBCKT INA240A1_FUNC INM GND REF2 NC OUT VS REF1 INP
* Original FUNCTIONAL equivalent, NOT a TI/manufacturer INA240 model.
* Port order follows physical SOIC-8: 1 IN-,2 GND,3 REF2,4 NC,
* 5 OUT,6 VS,7 REF1,8 IN+. NC has no modeled internal connection.
* Gain20; averaged reference pins; ideal rail clipping.
* Assumed1us pole and1ohm output resistance, NOT datasheet timing.
* No common-mode range/CMRR, input loading, offset, noise, supply current,
* gain error, temperature, PWM rejection or power-fail validation.
E_RAW RAW GND VALUE={LIMIT(20*V(INP,INM)+0.5*(V(REF1,GND)+V(REF2,GND)),0,MAX(V(VS,GND),0))}
R_POLE RAW FILTER 1k
C_POLE FILTER GND 1n
E_BUFFER BUFFER GND VALUE={V(FILTER,GND)}
R_OUTPUT BUFFER OUT 1
.ENDS INA240A1_FUNC
